    <DataNode elementId="ETHYLACETATE" textLabel="ethyl acetate" type="Metabolite">
      <Xref identifier="XEKOWRVHYACXOJ-UHFFFAOYSA-N" dataSource="InChIKey" />
      <Graphics centerX="200" centerY="400" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="3955e7" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="3955e7" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="chawkins">|FRAME: ETHYLACETATE &quot;Ethyl acetate&quot;| is one of the most important small volatile esters. It is used as a chemical solvent and is used in the synthesis of biodiesels, paints, adhesives, herbicides and resins |CITS: [16822671][21255288][ 24788328][25742923]|. Its annual production volume was estimated at 3.5 million tonnes in 2015, which corresponds to a $3.7 billion global market.</Comment>
